#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:61 9730bec02a0d4b52b0979702b9ed1c51
msgid ""
"For many boards, the GPIO pin numbers are assigned to PWM outputs for "
"alternate use can only be found by looking at that board's hwdef.dat file "
"`here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef>`__"
" ."
msgstr ""
"对于许多板子，分配给PWM输出用于备用功能的GPIO引脚编号，只能通过查看该板的hwdef.dat文件 `在此 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef>`__"
" 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:65 fd189d7c5c2047bb866810aff00d4ee3
msgid "Mounting the buzzer"
msgstr "安装蜂鸣器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:67 32c0b9db2a664810a1ed8de9ae7fab8e
msgid ""
"The sound from the buzzer can impact the accelerometers if placed too close "
"to the autopilot which can lead to poor altitude hold performance when the "
"buzzer is activated. The buzzer should ideally be mounted at least 5cm away "
"from the autopilot and the speaker (i.e. the open hole) should not be "
"pointing directly at the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"蜂鸣器若安装距飞控太近，其声音会影响加速度计，当蜂鸣器激活时可能导致高度保持性能变差。蜂鸣器理想情况下应距飞控至少5cm，且扬声器（即开孔）不应直接朝向飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:71 201498ac4fb94d4ea511903dd67fb5be
msgid "Silencing the buzzer"
msgstr "关闭蜂鸣器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:73 79c665e2b1df4c4fa0b1e280d40b184e
msgid ""
"Some autopilots (like the HobbyKing PixRacer) have built-in buzzers.  We "
"recommend disabling the these buzzers by setting the following parameter:"
msgstr "部分飞控（如HobbyKing PixRacer）内置蜂鸣器。建议通过设置以下参数来禁用这些内置蜂鸣器："

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:75 7c8201d4d8e04143a64cbfe866e2ff1d
msgid ""
":ref:`NTF_BUZZ_TYPES<NTF_BUZZ_TYPES>` controls which types of buzzers are "
"enabled: Pin driven buzzers (built-in or external), and/or DShot based on "
"ESCs."
msgstr ""
":ref:`NTF_BUZZ_TYPES<NTF_BUZZ_TYPES>` "
"控制启用哪些类型的蜂鸣器：引脚驱动蜂鸣器（内置或外置）和/或基于ESC的DShot蜂鸣。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buzzer.rst:77 500df22d90d845f6a191df54da8c9df6
msgid ""
"In addition, :ref:`NTF_BUZZ_VOLUME<NTF_BUZZ_VOLUME>` can be used to control "
"the volume."
msgstr "此外，:ref:`NTF_BUZZ_VOLUME<NTF_BUZZ_VOLUME>` 可用于控制音量。"
